TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-math-0104104v3
AU  - Foth, Philip
TI  - Geometry of Four-Vector Fields on Quaternionic Flag Manifolds
DA  - D:20210812
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0104104
AB  - The purpose of this paper is to describe certain natural 4-vector ﬁelds on quaternionic ﬂag manifolds, which geometrically determine the Bruhat cell decomposition. These structures naturally descend from the sym- plectic group Sp(n), and are related to the dressing action given by the Iwasawa decomposition of the general linear group over the quaternions, GLn(H).
ER  - 
